    {
      "id": "qnkX",
      "code_hash": "48d1f24436d3db7596b153e004ddc580",
      "outputs": [
        {
          "type": "data",
          "data": {
            "text/markdown": "<span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><hr />\n<h2 id=\"how-it-works\">\ud83d\udee0\ufe0f How It Works</h2>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">This widget is built with:</span>\n<ul>\n<li><strong><a href=\"https://anywidget.dev/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">anywidget</a></strong>: Framework for portable Jupyter/marimo widgets</li>\n<li><strong><a href=\"https://wavesurfer.xyz/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">wavesurfer.js</a></strong>: JavaScript audio waveform visualization library</li>\n<li><strong><a href=\"https://marimo.io/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">marimo</a></strong>: Reactive Python notebooks</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"architecture\">Architecture</h3>\n<div class=\"language-verilog codehilite\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"err\">\u250c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2510</span>\n<span class=\"err\">\u2502</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nl\">Python:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">WavesurferWidget</span><span class=\"w\">           </span><span class=\"err\">\u2502</span>\n<span class=\"err\">\u2502</span><span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"o\">-</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">audio_data</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">bytes</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"w\">               </span><span class=\"err\">\u2502</span>\n<span class=\"err\">\u2502</span><span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"o\">-</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">regions</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">list</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">of</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">dicts</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"w\">          </span><span class=\"err\">\u2502</span>\n<span class=\"err\">\u2502</span><span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"o\">-</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">current_time</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">float</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"w\">             </span><span class=\"err\">\u2502</span>\n<span class=\"err\">\u2502</span><span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"o\">-</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">is_playing</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">bool</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"w\">                </span><span class=\"err\">\u2502</span>\n<span class=\"err\">\u2514\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u252c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2518</span>\n<span class=\"w\">               </span><span class=\"err\">\u2502</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">traitlets</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">sync</span>\n<span class=\"err\">\u250c\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u25bc\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2510</span>\n<span class=\"err\">\u2502</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nl\">JavaScript:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">wavesurfer</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">js</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">ESM</span><span class=\"w\">       </span><span class=\"err\">\u2502</span>\n<span class=\"err\">\u2502</span><span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"o\">-</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Load</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">audio</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">from</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">data</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">URL</span><span class=\"w\">         </span><span class=\"err\">\u2502</span>\n<span class=\"err\">\u2502</span><span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"o\">-</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Render</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">waveform</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">+</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">regions</span><span class=\"w\">        </span><span class=\"err\">\u2502</span>\n<span class=\"err\">\u2502</span><span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"o\">-</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Emit</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">events</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"err\">\u2192</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">update</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Python</span><span class=\"w\">      </span><span class=\"err\">\u2502</span>\n<span class=\"err\">\u2514\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2518</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<h3 id=\"key-features\">Key Features</h3>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>Bidirectional State Sync</strong>: Changes in Python update the waveform; drag events in JS update Python</li>\n<li><strong>CDN Loading</strong>: No build step required - wavesurfer.js loads from CDN</li>\n<li><strong>Reactive</strong>: marimo automatically updates dependent cells when widget state changes</li>\n<li><strong>Portable</strong>: The same widget works in Jupyter, JupyterLab, Google Colab, and marimo</li>\n</ol>\n<h3 id=\"use-cases\">Use Cases</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Audio Transcription</strong>: Mark speaker turns or topics</li>\n<li><strong>Music Analysis</strong>: Annotate verses, choruses, bridges</li>\n<li><strong>Torah Study</strong>: Align Hebrew verses with audio recordings</li>\n<li><strong>Podcast Production</strong>: Chapter markers and segment boundaries</li>\n<li><strong>Language Learning</strong>: Sentence-level audio alignment</li>\n</ul>\n<hr />\n<h2 id=\"resources\">\ud83d\udcda Resources</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/your-repo/src/widgets/wavesurfer_widget.py\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">WavesurferWidget Source Code</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://wavesurfer.xyz/docs/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">wavesurfer.js Documentation</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://anywidget.dev/en/getting-started/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">anywidget Getting Started</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://marimo.io/gallery\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">marimo Gallery</a></li>\n</ul>\n<hr />\n<span class=\"paragraph\"><strong>Created by</strong>: Torah Sync Project\n<strong>Date</strong>: 2026-03-16\n<strong>License</strong>: MIT</span></span>"
          }
        }
      ],
      "console": []
    },
